  m_Name: Forest_AiraDiary_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Forest_AiraDiary_1
  headerName: "Aira's Diary \u2014 Entry 1"
  content: "\tSince the day the world came apart, the radio told us to go to the
    Lighthouse on the Summit. Before the signal died for good, it promised a refuge
    up there \u2014 evacuation, safety, light. I set out with Tawan and the others
    at first. But somewhere in the chaos of the road, I lost them. Now the path stretches
    on alone, and I don't know if Tawan is breathing.\n\r\n\tI've never been separated
    from her before. It gnaws at me. But I suppose she has the group, and the group
    has its numbers. I have only myself \u2014 so perhaps I'm the one who ought to
    be more afraid. Still. Maybe this solitary journey won't be so terrible. People
    have to try new things.\n\r\n\tEverything I encounter from here on, I'll write
    down. If I find something worth remembering, I want it remembered. An adventure
    journal \u2014 my own strange kind."
  type: 0
  biome: 0
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  dialogData: {fileID: 0}
